{"reviews":[{"id":"B089DQTSFB-0","r":1.0,"t":"I wanted to love this but...","x":"Unfortunately, it\u2019s not very good. I love the deotarent of this brand but the body wash is really drying, it doesn\u2019t clean your body well, and a lot goes a little way. The bottle didn\u2019t last me very long at all. Total bummer.","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-1","r":4.0,"t":"Body wash","x":"Love the smell and the product it\u2019s self but when I got this in the mail and one of the body washes lid broke and there was body wash all over in the box","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love this product","x":"Great for your skin.  Lathers really well.  Love the scent.  Makes my skin feel soft without harsh chemicals.  Will certainly buy again.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-3","r":3.0,"t":"Leaking bottle","x":"One of the bottles was open and leaked all over the packaging and other bottles.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-4","r":5.0,"t":"This stuff leaves you smiling!","x":"Old guy here, Ya this product leaves you feeling like a squeeky clean new car...most excellent body cleaner going in my book..a joy to use and no over powering scent. Awesome!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-5","r":5.0,"t":"Lots of lather & nice smell","x":"I wasn't too keen on buying a 3-pack, but so far I really like this body wash.  It doesn't take much and you get a nice moisturizing lather with a mild coconut smell.  It doesn't seem like there are many body washes available that don't have Sulfates, parabens, and other \"bad\" chemicals that still lather decently.  I have used and like Dr Wood, Dr Bronners and EMJ, but Native is my new favorite.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-6","r":5.0,"t":"Lots of lather & nice smell","x":"I wasn't too keen on buying a 3-pack, but so far I really like this body wash.  It doesn't take much and you get a nice moisturizing lather with a mild coconut smell.  It doesn't seem like there are many body washes available that don't have Sulfates, parabens, and other \"bad\" chemicals that still lather decently.  I have used and like Dr Wood, Dr Bronners and EMJ, but Native is my new favorite.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great Vegan Bodywash!","x":"Gentle cleaning body wash! Leaves the skin smooth, moist and not dry! No chemicals, no metals","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-8","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful and loving it!","x":"From the first time I used this body wash, I was sold. I have since reordered more and loving the way it leaves my skin feeling. I normally can\u2019t use body wash because of the irritation it causes to my chest. So what did I have to lose...nothing but I gained a new body wash!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-9","r":2.0,"t":"Not impressed","x":"I was thinking with the brand name the product would be excellent. The scent was way under par and reminded me of an old wax room air freshener that had lost almost all of its scent. The amount of body wash I had to use per shower was very excessive. I had gotten a 3 pack with different scents and the next was worst than the last. It does the job but I was not impressed and will not be buying again.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-10","r":3.0,"t":"Smells great but not cruelty free","x":"It presents itself as organic yet it's from a company that tests on animals. If you don't mind that then I recommend. Smells great, soft and rinses well. I thought it was cruelty free when I ordered it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-11","r":1.0,"t":"Not the same formula as store bought!","x":"The formula is not the same as store bought, dried our skin out. We went back to buying the same brand at target.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-12","r":3.0,"t":"Smells good but...","x":"Smells good, as I could smell the soap immediately as I opened the box because it was spilled all over the inside of the packaging. Kind of leaves a bad taste in your mouth even if it\u2019s a good product if the shipping wasn\u2019t proper.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-13","r":1.0,"t":"What a mess!","x":"I love the product, don\u2019t get me wrong, but when you order a three bottle package and two of the bottles are open and spilled everywhere it\u2019s a complete mess! What a hassle!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-14","r":4.0,"t":"Scent Isn\u2019t As Expected","x":"I\u2019ve used the deodorant forever & love the scent so I ordered this, but the smell isn\u2019t quite the same. And it runs out too quickly for the price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-15","r":5.0,"t":"HEALTHY SELFCARE!","x":"I Love NATURAL products!  I use this as shampoo, shaving cream and body wash.  My wife always says \u201cYou smell so goooood!\u201d  Happy customer!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-16","r":5.0,"t":"My skin feels clean and smooth","x":"The scent is perfect...not too strong and not too weak. My skin feels clean and smooth. I highly recommend this!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-17","r":5.0,"t":"Nice and not-powering scent.","x":"Price is right when you buy packets of 3. Coconut and Vanilla is my favorite scent.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-18","r":1.0,"t":"Nope!","x":"Left my skin dry, red, and itchy. Will stick to Jason.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-19","r":5.0,"t":"I think it\u2019s a really good value","x":"I love the scent. I love that it is not really strong.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-20","r":4.0,"t":"My favorite soap!","x":"This soap has the most amazing fragrance! It's so subtle yet pleasurable enough, unlike most soaps. It's ideal for washing your hands before doing delicate stuff, like putting on your contact lenses, washing your mouth guards, or washing ultradelicate fabric like your glasses cleaning cloth. The only thing that I don't like is that it's so hard to find at stores but other than that it's a great product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-21","r":5.0,"t":"Lasts a long time","x":"I happen to like the look of the container in the shower but also love the product. Nice fragrance and a little goes a long way. I would like to know that the fragrance came from natural oils but I suspect it doesn't since they don't clarify that point. Hard to find a completely non toxic body wash in a nice looking dispenser so I will still use this one.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-22","r":4.0,"t":"Lathers well, earthy scent","x":"It lathers really well, so it goes a long way compared to other body washes I\u2019ve used. The scent wasn\u2019t quite what I thought it would be though; I was expecting tropical coconut, like a pina colada. But it was more earthy, and had what I\u2019d consider like notes of tobacco? Not unpleasant but just wasn\u2019t quite what I was hoping for, personally.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-23","r":5.0,"t":"No soapy residue","x":"I\u2019ve been using Native deodorant for about a year now, but I just discovered the body wash in December. I love the fragrances! A small dollop lathers nicely and rinses cleanly. And I love that the body wash doesn\u2019t leave a soapy residue on your skin like other brands often do.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B089DQTSFB-24","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE Native Products","x":"This has become my absolute favorite body wash!!!  I love the fact that it is natural ...it cleanses well and the Coconut Vanilla smells wonderful!!!  Thank you,  Native for offering such a great product at a reasonable price!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the pleasant scent and good lather.","cites":[3,5,6,7,8]},{"text":"Several reviewers report bottles arriving open, leaking, or spilled in the packaging.","cites":[2,4,13,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the product is drying or irritates their skin, while others find it moisturizing and gentle.","cites":[1,3,8,9,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the product runs out quickly or requires excessive amounts per use.","cites":[1,10,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers question the brand's claims, citing animal testing or a different formula than store-bought.","cites":[11,12]}]},"qa":[]}